title A grab in your own box
intro Red is attacking your goal.
flip vertical

setup
  lineup 7v7
  player R-LF at 12, 30
  player B-CB at 12, 38
  ball with R-LF

step
  caption Red is inside your big box with the ball.
  draw penalty-area left

step
  caption A Blue defender grabs their shirt and pulls them back.
  B-CB to 12, 33
  label B-CB Pull
  arrow from B-CB to R-LF
  banner Foul
  draw penalty-area left
  duration 1100

question
  prompt What does Red get?
  answer A penalty kick
  wrong A free kick
  wrong A corner
  wrong A throw-in
  correct A penalty kick.
  why Grabbing a shirt is a foul, and this one was inside your own box, so Red shoots from the spot.

question
  prompt Why is this worse than a foul in the middle?
  answer It is in your own box
  wrong Red was running fast
  wrong It was near the sideline
  wrong The ball was in the air
  correct It happened in your own box.
  why The same foul in the middle is only a free kick. Inside your own box it becomes a penalty kick.
